core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-17T07:34:27-08:00","id":1531023,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt Corleone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1531019-requiem-bundle-at-storyteller-s-vault?p=1531020#post1531020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if they're going to do a First Edition bundle in August for the 20th Anniversary?</div> </div> </div> </div>That would be cool! It is probably a question of intellectual property, where Onyx Path cannot decide to do such a thing with the first edition of VtR. Would the current IP-owner do it? Well, they seem to be OK with a bundle being sold of <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/187576/Hunter-the-Vigil-1e-Complete-BUNDLE?affiliate_id=321987&amp;\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter: the Vigil's first edition</a>, so there could be hope for VtR.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27293,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27293-cabaal","user":"Cabaal","date":". 02-17-2024, 03:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27293-cabaal","name":"Cabaal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27293_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-17T11:25:33-08:00","id":1531029,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cabaal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1531019-requiem-bundle-at-storyteller-s-vault#post1531019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am very excited to find a <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/471227/Vampire-The-Requiem-2E-Collection-BUNDLE?affiliate_id=321987&amp;\" target=\"_blank\">bundle containing everything ever published for Vampire: The Requiem</a>, second edition at the Storyteller's Vault. Great offer, but I also feel a little bit of sadness, as it most probably underlines that there are no new books coming up for the line. I think most of us fans already were aware of it, but now it is more spelled out.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I don't want to invalidate that sadness, cause I feel it too, I will point out that this bundle doesn't mean the line is over. While the current IP owners don't seem interested in approving anything official, things do change over time and it is likely one day Chronicles of Darkness will return. World of Darkness went through this and survived, we will too. <br /> <br /> But also, those of us over at None More Dark publishing have been working hard to make sure the game don't die. There's also a <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/471004/A-Coterie-and-a-Changeling-BUNDLE?affiliate_id=498510\" target=\"_blank\">bundle of everything we've made</a> if you haven't seen it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\"